WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:08.796
You can add your own shortcuts to the sidebar. This tutorial uses fictional

2
00:00:08.796 --> 00:00:10.328
demonstration data.

3
00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:15.309
Select the plus beside Operations to open Add menu item.

4
00:00:15.776 --> 00:00:22.624
A shortcut can be an Object, which is a Crewflow page, a filtered View, a Record, a

5
00:00:22.624 --> 00:00:24.109
Folder, or a Link.

6
00:00:24.561 --> 00:00:28.115
Choose View, and pick a filtered list.

7
00:00:28.575 --> 00:00:32.899
Give the shortcut a name and an icon, then select Add.

8
00:00:33.359 --> 00:00:39.972
The shortcut appears under Operations. Opening it goes through the normal page, so

9
00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:42.552
your usual access still applies.

10
00:00:43.015 --> 00:00:49.314
Use the options button on a shortcut to rename or remove it. Shortcuts are saved on

11
00:00:49.314 --> 00:00:52.653
this device, for your account and workspace.
